WEBVTT

01:38.120 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.130 --> 01:44.009
[Episode 31]

01:57.310 --> 02:00.110
You were originally from the Mystic Panther Clan.

02:00.280 --> 02:01.870
Someone used a secret technique

02:01.870 --> 02:04.430
to suppress your beastly nature for nearly 10 years.

02:04.430 --> 02:06.280
Suddenly breaking free from the restraints,

02:06.280 --> 02:07.710
it's naturally difficult to control yourself.

02:07.710 --> 02:09.039
If you can't control it,

02:09.150 --> 02:10.710
then don't try to control it anymore.

02:10.710 --> 02:12.040
Follow your bloodline.

02:12.590 --> 02:13.790
Do what you want to do.

02:15.710 --> 02:16.840
You are so powerful.

02:17.240 --> 02:17.970
This world

02:18.490 --> 02:20.220
should be your hunting ground.

02:20.470 --> 02:21.360
It's you?

02:22.520 --> 02:23.250
How about it?

02:24.240 --> 02:24.960
Now you know

02:24.960 --> 02:26.690
your true identity, don't you?

02:30.870 --> 02:32.800
Why are you looking at me like that?

02:34.490 --> 02:36.220
I'm just telling you the truth.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.250
You don't hate those who kept it from you,

02:38.250 --> 02:39.579
but you hate me instead?

02:41.630 --> 02:43.160
You're really ungrateful.

02:43.920 --> 02:45.180
None of your business.

02:45.800 --> 02:46.860
You are my brother.

02:47.060 --> 02:48.720
Of course this is my business.

02:49.630 --> 02:50.800
I won't go with you.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.030
Dream on!

02:54.840 --> 02:55.970
You're so stubborn.

02:56.680 --> 02:58.340
I'll beat some sense into you.

03:16.980 --> 03:17.540
Xuanye!

03:23.400 --> 03:25.260
If you have the guts, just kill me.

03:27.120 --> 03:28.920
You'd rather die than be a demon.

03:29.910 --> 03:30.560
What kind of

03:30.560 --> 03:31.840
spell did they put you under

03:31.840 --> 03:33.100
to make you so devoted?

03:37.840 --> 03:39.300
I'll ask you one more time.

03:39.650 --> 03:41.250
Are you coming with me or not?

03:42.329 --> 03:43.790
Don't even think about it.

03:45.150 --> 03:45.750
Fine.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.030
Fine.

03:47.430 --> 03:49.290
Humans and demons can't coexist.

03:49.630 --> 03:50.590
You're a demon,

03:50.910 --> 03:52.520
yet you're desperate to be human.

03:52.520 --> 03:53.980
Then I'll grant your wish.

03:54.030 --> 03:54.960
I'll let you see

03:55.400 --> 03:57.460
whether anyone will still accept you

03:57.560 --> 03:59.470
if your identity is exposed.

04:05.860 --> 04:07.540
Xuanye, are you alright?

04:39.430 --> 04:40.000
Father,

04:40.870 --> 04:41.600
Mother,

04:42.390 --> 04:43.159
Big Brother,

04:44.600 --> 04:46.060
I've come to see you again.

04:47.720 --> 04:48.670
All these years,

04:49.630 --> 04:51.760
whenever I return from demon hunting,

04:52.240 --> 04:53.700
I always come to visit you,

04:54.360 --> 04:56.870
clean your room,

04:58.159 --> 04:59.360
and tell you

04:59.800 --> 05:01.000
about my experiences

05:01.490 --> 05:02.750
while hunting demons.

05:05.720 --> 05:06.600
It's as if

05:08.090 --> 05:09.690
you're right here beside me.

05:20.310 --> 05:20.830
Father,

05:23.040 --> 05:24.500
I never understood before

05:25.510 --> 05:26.160
why

05:27.160 --> 05:27.680
I couldn't remember

05:27.680 --> 05:29.080
anything before I was 12,

05:30.720 --> 05:31.390
why

05:32.190 --> 05:34.120
you gave me the Peerless Bracelet,

05:35.430 --> 05:36.159
why

05:37.000 --> 05:39.600
you wouldn't let me go to the Underground City,

05:40.159 --> 05:40.600
and why

05:40.630 --> 05:42.490
all of you were poisoned by demons

05:43.360 --> 05:45.020
while I alone was unaffected.

05:47.750 --> 05:48.390
Now,

05:49.750 --> 05:51.210
I understand everything.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.430
It's actually quite simple.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.000
Because

05:59.360 --> 06:00.230
I am a demon.

06:00.860 --> 06:04.470
♫Just sobered up after a dream, sighing for my life♫

06:03.360 --> 06:04.270
A demon

06:04.490 --> 06:07.370
♫In this desolate mortal world♫

06:06.000 --> 06:07.720
who ended up as a demon hunter.

06:08.050 --> 06:10.390
♫The other side sees fantasies fading into obscurity♫

06:09.240 --> 06:10.310
How ironic.

06:10.410 --> 06:14.190
♫Is it a blessing or a calamity?♫

06:16.540 --> 06:18.480
♫I'm all alone♫

06:18.510 --> 06:20.380
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

06:20.410 --> 06:23.070
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

06:21.270 --> 06:21.730
Father,

06:23.360 --> 06:24.750
you once told me

06:23.780 --> 06:26.180
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

06:26.210 --> 06:34.080
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

06:26.390 --> 06:28.120
that people can be good or evil,

06:28.720 --> 06:29.320
and demons

06:29.630 --> 06:30.800
are the same.

06:31.560 --> 06:32.690
I can't generalize.

06:34.080 --> 06:36.080
♫If there were no regrets♫

06:34.720 --> 06:35.800
Only I can

06:36.159 --> 06:38.150
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

06:36.830 --> 06:38.480
decide who I am.

06:38.180 --> 06:41.159
♫To illuminate the world?♫

06:41.330 --> 06:42.220
But now,

06:41.530 --> 06:45.159
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

06:43.790 --> 06:44.720
who am I?

06:45.770 --> 06:49.420
♫Before daybreak♫

06:49.240 --> 06:49.870
Father,

06:49.500 --> 06:51.440
♫May you have no regrets♫

06:51.470 --> 06:53.040
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

06:51.480 --> 06:52.240
do you know?

06:53.060 --> 06:56.900
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

06:57.290 --> 06:59.530
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

06:59.570 --> 07:01.430
♫If we luck out♫

07:00.920 --> 07:01.600
I'm leaving.

07:01.460 --> 07:07.220
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

07:04.680 --> 07:05.940
I won't be coming back.

07:13.130 --> 07:15.080
♫I'm all alone♫

07:15.100 --> 07:16.980
♫Braving the snowstorm♫

07:17.000 --> 07:19.660
♫Struck by sudden amnesia♫

07:20.370 --> 07:22.780
♫Wait until the last peach blossom falls♫

07:22.800 --> 07:30.680
♫Glance back with love for 10,000 years♫

07:30.680 --> 07:32.670
♫If there were no regrets♫

07:32.760 --> 07:34.750
♫Why would the starlight still remain♫

07:34.770 --> 07:37.750
♫To illuminate the world?♫

07:38.120 --> 07:41.760
♫Coated in starlight, holding gleaming swords♫

07:42.360 --> 07:46.010
♫Before daybreak♫

07:45.390 --> 07:45.990
How is she?

07:46.100 --> 07:48.040
♫May you have no regrets♫

07:48.060 --> 07:49.630
♫Together, through seas and mountains♫

07:49.430 --> 07:50.070
The fever has gone down.

07:49.650 --> 07:53.500
♫If all must fade away and be forgotten♫

07:53.890 --> 07:56.120
♫I'd keep it all to myself♫

07:55.720 --> 07:56.270
She's okay.

07:56.170 --> 07:58.030
♫If we luck out♫

07:58.050 --> 08:03.820
♫Let's reunite once again beyond the time♫

08:13.240 --> 08:14.040
Come quickly!

08:17.320 --> 08:18.150
Let's begin!

08:18.510 --> 08:19.770
Come on, pass the ball!

08:37.440 --> 08:38.240
Give it to me!

09:10.580 --> 09:11.270
Xuanye,

09:11.830 --> 09:13.690
will we ever return to Guangping?

09:15.150 --> 09:15.880
I don't know.

09:17.360 --> 09:18.560
Then where will we go?

09:21.480 --> 09:22.240
I don't know.

09:24.080 --> 09:26.410
Should we open a pharmacy somewhere else?

09:31.390 --> 09:32.000
Xuanye,

09:32.360 --> 09:34.020
if you have nowhere else to go,

09:34.200 --> 09:35.660
why don't you come with me?

09:37.090 --> 09:38.090
You taught me how to be human before

09:38.090 --> 09:39.240
and you did a good job.

09:39.240 --> 09:41.700
Now it's my turn to teach you how to be a demon.

09:41.840 --> 09:42.550
Don't worry.

09:42.550 --> 09:44.150
I'm sure I can teach you well.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.500
If you're willing,

09:45.790 --> 09:47.850
you could even be my companion demon.

09:50.050 --> 09:51.640
Or I could be your companion demon.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.440
I don't care about these things.

09:57.840 --> 09:58.510
Chi Xue.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.790
Don't follow me anymore.

10:04.770 --> 10:05.290
Why?

10:06.120 --> 10:07.180
When I transform,

10:07.210 --> 10:08.360
my mind becomes chaotic.

10:08.360 --> 10:09.690
I can't control myself.

10:09.960 --> 10:11.240
I'm afraid I might hurt you.

10:11.240 --> 10:11.960
It's okay.

10:12.150 --> 10:13.150
I can run fast.

10:13.840 --> 10:15.440
Next time, I'll run as soon as you transform.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.320
I'll come back when you return to human form.

10:17.320 --> 10:19.450
I promise you won't be able to catch me.

10:22.600 --> 10:23.120
Xuanye,

10:23.910 --> 10:24.770
don't be upset.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.510
There's nothing wrong with being a demon.

10:27.510 --> 10:29.150
Didn't your father say before

10:29.150 --> 10:30.770
that humans and demons are the same?

10:30.770 --> 10:32.430
As long as you act righteously,

10:32.430 --> 10:34.230
there's nothing to be afraid of.

10:35.960 --> 10:37.090
I'm a panther demon.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.270
Aren't you afraid I'll eat you?

10:40.480 --> 10:41.390
You are Xuanye.

10:41.510 --> 10:43.040
Xuanye never eats rabbits.

10:43.600 --> 10:44.000
Hurry!

10:44.240 --> 10:46.080
Don't let that panther demon escape!

10:46.080 --> 10:46.960
The demon is over there!

10:46.960 --> 10:47.910
Quick, let's go!

10:48.000 --> 10:49.060
Over there, hurry!

10:49.390 --> 10:49.840
Hurry!

10:50.150 --> 10:52.550
It's over there! Let's go, quick, quick, quick!

10:52.550 --> 10:53.320
Hurry up!

10:54.670 --> 10:56.030
They said panther demon.

10:56.030 --> 10:56.750
Could it be...

10:56.750 --> 10:57.950
Let's go check it out.

10:59.240 --> 11:01.080
We've searched everywhere, inside and outside the city.

11:01.080 --> 11:01.870
There's not

11:01.870 --> 11:03.270
a single trace of Xuanye.

11:03.910 --> 11:05.880
Banxia has left with her parents.

11:05.900 --> 11:08.230
He'll be furious when he hears about this.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.360
This guy...

11:09.360 --> 11:10.160
Seriously...

11:10.730 --> 11:11.290
He left without even

11:11.290 --> 11:12.490
saying goodbye to us.

11:14.840 --> 11:15.370
Wen Jian.

11:16.340 --> 11:17.340
Who are those two?

11:21.930 --> 11:22.780
They must be

11:22.810 --> 11:24.810
the demon hunters the lord invited.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.320
Demon hunters?

11:27.150 --> 11:28.390
Hasn't Xuanye already gone?

11:28.390 --> 11:30.060
Why do we need other demon hunters?

11:30.060 --> 11:31.090
Xuanye was supposed to

11:31.090 --> 11:32.630
get married recently, wasn't he?

11:32.630 --> 11:33.080
You think the lord

11:33.080 --> 11:34.540
is as shortsighted as you?

11:35.870 --> 11:36.520
Bad news!

11:37.120 --> 11:37.720
Bad news!

11:38.910 --> 11:39.480
Chief Constable Chu,

11:39.480 --> 11:40.320
Chief Constable Wen,

11:40.320 --> 11:41.360
the panther demon...

11:41.360 --> 11:43.490
The panther demon has appeared again!

11:49.510 --> 11:50.790
The demonic aura is strong.

11:50.790 --> 11:52.450
It must be in these mountains.

11:53.270 --> 11:54.270
I can smell it too.

11:55.120 --> 11:55.780
Where is it?

11:57.630 --> 11:58.830
It's coming from you.

12:03.720 --> 12:05.180
Let's split up and search.

12:07.910 --> 12:08.670
Chi Xue.

12:11.680 --> 12:12.520
Be careful.

12:12.870 --> 12:14.070
Don't try to be a hero.

12:14.360 --> 12:15.000
Got it!

12:18.270 --> 12:19.910
Mother!

12:20.360 --> 12:22.390
I want to go home!

12:23.330 --> 12:25.240
Mother!

12:25.270 --> 12:27.880
I want to go home!

12:43.520 --> 12:45.160
Mother!

12:46.510 --> 12:48.670
I want to go home!

12:50.630 --> 12:52.550
Mother!

12:52.670 --> 12:55.240
I want to go home!

12:58.870 --> 13:00.790
I want to go home!

13:00.790 --> 13:03.360
I want to go home!

13:07.750 --> 13:08.840
I'm scared.

13:20.600 --> 13:21.480
You're fast.

13:22.550 --> 13:23.200
Demon!

13:26.000 --> 13:27.800
Are you talking about yourself?

15:28.360 --> 15:29.080
So fierce.

15:32.790 --> 15:33.390
Very well.

15:33.910 --> 15:34.960
Since you like to play,

15:34.960 --> 15:36.020
I'll play with you.

15:38.900 --> 15:40.430
Nine Spirits Suppression.

15:40.440 --> 15:41.570
Reverse Blood Flow!

16:04.360 --> 16:05.020
How's that?

16:05.440 --> 16:06.240
Fun, isn't it?

16:08.390 --> 16:11.150
This is the Heart-Killing Technique that Father taught me personally.

16:11.150 --> 16:12.810
I never thought the first time

16:12.820 --> 16:14.220
I'd use it would be on you.

16:14.390 --> 16:14.920
How is it?

16:15.790 --> 16:17.150
Compared to the techniques

16:17.150 --> 16:18.810
your human father taught you,

16:18.840 --> 16:19.480
which is

16:19.870 --> 16:20.500
superior?

16:24.630 --> 16:26.440
I've sealed your transformation ability.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.500
For the time being,

16:27.670 --> 16:30.530
don't even think about changing back to human form.

16:30.660 --> 16:31.190
Man Ying,

16:31.390 --> 16:32.190
don't hate me.

16:33.480 --> 16:34.610
All my arrangements

16:35.320 --> 16:36.650
were simply to teach you

16:36.710 --> 16:39.640
why they say humans and demons walk different paths.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.480
Time is short.

16:42.830 --> 16:43.960
Understand it soon.

16:54.030 --> 16:54.630
Over here!

17:01.240 --> 17:02.370
You insolent demon,

17:02.440 --> 17:03.870
you dared to enter the city

17:03.870 --> 17:05.310
and hurt people in broad daylight.

17:05.310 --> 17:06.440
The demon is injured.

17:06.440 --> 17:06.900
Kill it!

17:07.069 --> 17:07.480
Kill!

18:00.500 --> 18:02.030
Demon, prepare to die!

18:14.880 --> 18:15.630
Chi Xue!

18:18.200 --> 18:18.930
How was that?

18:19.160 --> 18:20.090
Am I impressive?

18:24.720 --> 18:25.980
Run! I'll protect you.

18:26.910 --> 18:27.730
Go!

18:28.760 --> 18:29.700
Go!

19:22.440 --> 19:23.000
Go...

20:03.200 --> 20:05.200
Just a beast waiting for slaughter.

20:05.400 --> 20:06.030
Everyone,

20:06.830 --> 20:07.830
subdue the demon!

20:32.470 --> 20:33.200
My Lady.

20:35.590 --> 20:36.200
My Lady!

20:37.480 --> 20:38.070
Banxia.

20:38.600 --> 20:39.360
Banxia!

20:39.400 --> 20:40.030
My Lady!

20:40.880 --> 20:41.400
Banxia!

20:42.790 --> 20:43.310
Banxia.

20:43.920 --> 20:44.400
Banxia.

20:44.820 --> 20:45.750
What's wrong, Banxia?

20:45.750 --> 20:47.150
Did you have a nightmare?

20:49.270 --> 20:49.750
Banxia.

20:57.350 --> 20:58.200
Where are we?

21:00.170 --> 21:00.760
We are

21:00.790 --> 21:03.120
on our way back to our hometown in Nanyang.

21:05.480 --> 21:06.110
Banxia.

21:06.720 --> 21:07.380
Last night,

21:07.970 --> 21:09.700
you were delirious with fever.

21:10.090 --> 21:11.790
Your father was afraid that when you woke up,

21:11.790 --> 21:13.010
you wouldn't want to leave.

21:13.010 --> 21:15.130
So he made the decision early this morning

21:15.130 --> 21:16.640
and we set off for home.

21:18.430 --> 21:21.960
♫Melody echoes along the river; wild geese soar in sudden fright♫

21:19.240 --> 21:19.790
Mother.

21:22.440 --> 21:25.120
♫The music ends, and I stand in solitude♫

21:23.030 --> 21:24.200
I can't leave.

21:25.070 --> 21:26.330
Mother, I can't leave.

21:26.760 --> 21:29.990
♫I see you turn into a handful of starlight♫

21:29.260 --> 21:29.980
I know.

21:30.470 --> 21:34.300
♫Drifting past me♫

21:31.080 --> 21:33.010
I know Grandmother is getting old.

21:33.240 --> 21:34.660
She needs me to go back and keep her company.

21:34.660 --> 21:36.140
I should go back,

21:34.770 --> 21:38.550
♫In tears, the past memories still glow♫

21:37.550 --> 21:38.720
but Xuanye is now

21:38.720 --> 21:39.920
in danger.

21:38.910 --> 21:42.050
♫Crystallized into cold amber♫

21:40.650 --> 21:42.370
I can't leave him alone.

21:42.210 --> 21:46.800
♫I know it also brought you great pain to let go♫

21:43.480 --> 21:45.160
I can't abandon him.

21:45.590 --> 21:46.350
Banxia.

21:47.190 --> 21:49.200
♫But why did you♫

21:47.310 --> 21:48.510
But if you go back now,

21:48.510 --> 21:49.640
what can you do?

21:49.510 --> 21:53.800
♫Still endure the pain and shatter♫

21:50.070 --> 21:51.400
I can stay with him.

21:51.960 --> 21:53.110
I can comfort him.

21:53.830 --> 21:55.070
If he's in danger,

21:54.140 --> 21:58.630
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

21:55.110 --> 21:56.310
I can save him.

21:57.550 --> 21:58.200
Mother,

21:58.550 --> 22:00.450
you've been locked up before.

21:58.730 --> 22:02.410
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

22:00.480 --> 22:02.410
You've been restrained by others.

22:02.690 --> 22:04.630
♫I hate that I failed♫

22:03.270 --> 22:04.070
You know it.

22:04.350 --> 22:05.960
You definitely don't want to be abandoned

22:04.660 --> 22:09.980
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

22:06.200 --> 22:07.110
and left behind,

22:07.110 --> 22:07.550
right?

22:09.400 --> 22:09.880
Mother,

22:09.880 --> 22:10.750
please help me.

22:10.350 --> 22:14.550
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

22:11.590 --> 22:12.750
I can't go.

22:14.580 --> 22:19.440
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

22:16.510 --> 22:17.770
These fruits are good.

22:18.310 --> 22:18.720
I will

22:19.070 --> 22:20.210
bring some to Banxia.

22:20.210 --> 22:26.390
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

22:20.550 --> 22:21.080
Alright.

22:21.160 --> 22:21.750
Come on,

22:22.070 --> 22:22.800
give me some.

22:23.160 --> 22:23.590
Okay.

22:24.350 --> 22:25.280
And this one too.

22:25.570 --> 22:26.630
Let's go, let's go.

22:34.730 --> 22:35.330
Tingzhou.

22:35.830 --> 22:36.760
Is Banxia awake?

22:37.920 --> 22:38.640
Not yet.

22:41.260 --> 22:41.790
Banxia.

22:43.010 --> 22:47.200
♫Remember me, don't miss me♫

22:47.420 --> 22:51.300
♫Don't put the blame on yourself for my solitude♫

22:49.120 --> 22:49.720
Tingzhou.

22:50.070 --> 22:51.070
Where did she go?

22:51.590 --> 22:53.510
♫I hate that I failed♫

22:53.540 --> 22:58.910
♫To catch the glistening starlight♫

22:59.250 --> 23:03.690
♫We were meant to miss each other in this life♫

23:03.720 --> 23:08.430
♫Only after missing did we learn how much love could hurt♫

23:08.900 --> 23:14.930
♫To have loved you is to have truly lived♫

23:28.480 --> 23:29.080
Lord Geng.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.460
Immortal Masters,

23:33.560 --> 23:35.440
how should we

23:35.460 --> 23:36.520
handle that beast?

23:38.230 --> 23:40.230
This beast is a black panther demon.

23:40.240 --> 23:41.200
This demon is fierce.

23:41.200 --> 23:42.270
With just my disciple and I alone,

23:42.270 --> 23:44.070
it's difficult to eliminate it.

23:44.070 --> 23:44.750
However,

23:45.170 --> 23:46.200
I have already informed my sect

23:46.200 --> 23:48.200
and requested my master to handle it.

23:48.200 --> 23:49.260
That's excellent.

23:49.750 --> 23:50.270
Well,

23:50.440 --> 23:52.640
I'll leave it to you two Immortal Masters to handle then.

23:52.640 --> 23:53.400
Please,

23:53.590 --> 23:56.640
don't let that demon suddenly attack and harm people again.

23:56.640 --> 23:58.400
Please rest assured, Lord Geng.

23:58.400 --> 23:59.660
With the two of us here,

23:59.880 --> 24:00.680
it won't dare.

24:02.540 --> 24:04.070
Thank you for your efforts.

24:06.750 --> 24:07.390
Master,

24:08.290 --> 24:09.820
this demon is quite fierce.

24:11.700 --> 24:13.050
On the way back, I've already sent a letter

24:13.050 --> 24:14.780
to that lord in the Underground City.

24:14.780 --> 24:16.120
Once we receive the reward,

24:16.120 --> 24:17.110
we'll hand it over.

24:17.110 --> 24:17.770
This matter

24:18.070 --> 24:20.070
will then have nothing to do with us.

24:22.160 --> 24:22.640
Master,

24:23.110 --> 24:24.330
haven't we seen

24:24.360 --> 24:26.020
this demon somewhere before?

24:26.430 --> 24:27.360
What do you mean?

24:28.510 --> 24:29.370
Just a feeling.

24:29.880 --> 24:30.640
Feeling?

24:31.790 --> 24:33.070
Your cultivation is not sufficient.

24:33.070 --> 24:34.480
Don't let your imagination run wild all day.

24:34.480 --> 24:36.010
Focus on your cultivation.

24:42.440 --> 24:43.030
[Ganshan Clinic]

25:04.990 --> 25:06.050
What are you doing?

25:07.880 --> 25:08.750
The lord said

25:09.070 --> 25:10.270
it's the demon hunters' duty to exorcise demons

25:10.270 --> 25:11.400
and protect the Way.

25:11.810 --> 25:13.940
No one is allowed to give them trouble.

25:16.480 --> 25:16.880
But...

25:17.590 --> 25:19.120
If it weren't for those two.

25:19.720 --> 25:21.250
Chi Xue wouldn't have died.

25:21.310 --> 25:22.550
Chi Xue was a demon.

25:24.440 --> 25:25.310
Do you want to seek justice

25:25.310 --> 25:27.370
for a demon in the government office?

25:29.590 --> 25:30.650
Even if you want to,

25:31.640 --> 25:33.370
you must plan for the long term.

25:44.110 --> 25:45.540
Besides, I always feel

25:46.420 --> 25:48.420
something is off about this matter.

25:50.200 --> 25:51.160
Why would Chi Xue be willing

25:51.160 --> 25:52.400
to risk his own life

25:54.030 --> 25:55.560
to help that panther demon?

26:22.550 --> 26:24.080
Stop it! All of you, stop it!

26:24.670 --> 26:25.590
What are you trying to do?

26:25.590 --> 26:26.570
There's a demon locked up in here.

26:26.570 --> 26:28.110
You're being way too reckless!

26:28.110 --> 26:28.550
Demon?

26:28.680 --> 26:29.940
So what if it's a demon?

26:30.080 --> 26:31.270
It ate my child!

26:31.300 --> 26:32.080
A life for a life!

26:32.080 --> 26:33.480
I want it to pay with its life!

26:33.480 --> 26:35.280
Right, make it pay with its life!

26:37.110 --> 26:37.990
Fellow villagers!

26:37.990 --> 26:40.240
Everyone, please calm down and listen to me.

26:40.240 --> 26:42.330
The demon indeed deserves to die.

26:42.750 --> 26:44.480
It's our responsibility as demon hunters

26:44.480 --> 26:45.880
to eliminate evil demons

26:46.310 --> 26:47.640
and protect the people.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.720
However, this demon is fierce and dangerous.

26:50.720 --> 26:52.380
Ordinary methods won't work against it.

26:52.380 --> 26:54.310
You won't be able to kill it either.

26:54.830 --> 26:55.490
Therefore,

26:56.500 --> 26:58.300
we need to take it back to our sect

26:58.920 --> 27:00.680
and let my master deal with it.

27:00.830 --> 27:01.430
Nonsense!

27:01.440 --> 27:02.770
How can it not be killed?

27:02.780 --> 27:03.920
I don't care what kind of demon it is.

27:03.920 --> 27:04.400
Today,

27:04.400 --> 27:05.920
I'll burn it to death with fire!

27:05.920 --> 27:07.240
You can't take the demon away!

27:07.240 --> 27:08.640
We must burn it to death right here!

27:08.640 --> 27:09.640
Stop making trouble!

27:09.640 --> 27:10.960
Stop causing a commotion!

27:10.960 --> 27:12.920
Oh, my son...

27:14.270 --> 27:14.880
Burn it to death.

27:14.880 --> 27:15.590
We must burn it to death today!

27:15.590 --> 27:16.750
I'm 36 years old

27:16.750 --> 27:18.680
and only had this one son,

27:18.920 --> 27:20.720
but it ate him!

27:20.860 --> 27:21.680
I don't care!

27:21.680 --> 27:23.270
I want it to pay with its life!

27:23.270 --> 27:25.070
The demon must pay with its life!

27:31.110 --> 27:31.910
It's that one!

27:32.150 --> 27:32.920
Fellow villagers,

27:32.920 --> 27:34.760
this is the one that harmed my child!

27:34.760 --> 27:36.290
I'll fight you to the death!

27:36.710 --> 27:38.950
Kill it! Burn it to death!

27:39.550 --> 27:40.510
All of you, stop!

27:41.200 --> 27:42.310
Whoever causes more trouble

27:42.310 --> 27:43.310
will be locked up!

27:47.500 --> 27:48.900
Who let the villagers in?

27:49.270 --> 27:50.350
Ask your own men

27:51.070 --> 27:52.590
why they didn't stop the villagers

27:52.590 --> 27:53.720
from barging in.

27:54.860 --> 27:56.790
Why did you lower this black cloth?

27:57.750 --> 28:00.070
The villagers have harbored too much resentment.

28:00.070 --> 28:02.350
It's good to let them vent a little.

28:03.110 --> 28:04.610
Who gave you the authority?

28:04.610 --> 28:05.980
Lord Geng has already

28:06.480 --> 28:08.410
entrusted me to manage this place.

28:09.650 --> 28:11.250
Come with me to see Lord Geng.

28:14.590 --> 28:15.790
Chief Constable Wen!

28:17.110 --> 28:17.720
Banxia.

28:19.270 --> 28:21.130
Any news about Xuanye and Chi Xue?

28:21.150 --> 28:22.440
I just went to Ganshan Clinic,

28:22.440 --> 28:23.720
but the door was still closed.

28:23.720 --> 28:24.850
Have they returned?

28:27.310 --> 28:27.590
I...

28:30.110 --> 28:32.110
Did something happen?

28:36.110 --> 28:37.920
This morning, a panther demon appeared

28:37.920 --> 28:40.250
and abducted a child outside the academy.

28:40.770 --> 28:41.400
Lord Geng

28:41.520 --> 28:43.120
summoned two demon hunters.

28:44.590 --> 28:45.520
For some reason,

28:46.510 --> 28:48.030
Chi Xue desperately protected

28:48.030 --> 28:49.490
that black panther demon.

28:50.110 --> 28:50.440
He...

28:53.550 --> 28:53.960
He...

29:03.030 --> 29:04.960
Chi Xue died?

29:21.420 --> 29:23.080
Xuanye has also disappeared.

29:24.480 --> 29:26.740
He probably doesn't know about this yet.

29:33.750 --> 29:35.400
What about that panther demon?

29:35.400 --> 29:36.930
Where is the panther demon?

29:37.680 --> 29:39.650
It was captured by those two demon hunters.

29:39.650 --> 29:41.450
It's locked up in the courtyard.

29:42.480 --> 29:43.070
Demon!

29:43.090 --> 29:44.550
Kill the demon! Demon!

29:44.550 --> 29:47.110
Beat the demon! Kill it! Burn it!

29:47.480 --> 29:48.550
Stop! Don't hit it anymore!

29:48.550 --> 29:50.280
Stop smashing! Stop smashing!

30:03.850 --> 30:05.030
Stop hitting it!

30:12.240 --> 30:13.270
I'm sorry.

30:15.070 --> 30:16.030
It's my fault.

30:16.030 --> 30:17.370
I didn't tell you.

30:23.000 --> 30:23.590
Tell me

30:23.590 --> 30:24.790
how I can help you escape,

30:24.790 --> 30:25.270
Xuanye.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.070
Tell me quickly.

30:27.090 --> 30:27.610
Tell me

30:27.640 --> 30:29.270
how I can help you escape!

30:35.600 --> 30:36.340
Kill it!

30:37.200 --> 30:37.750
Kill it!

30:38.310 --> 30:39.440
We can't let it live!

30:54.200 --> 30:55.270
Run!

30:59.520 --> 31:00.310
Banxia!

31:16.680 --> 31:17.660
Banxia! Ban—

31:22.200 --> 31:22.920
Banxia!

31:25.310 --> 31:26.310
Get out of the way!

32:07.950 --> 32:09.270
There's no one here anymore.

32:09.270 --> 32:10.130
Xuanye, you...

32:13.400 --> 32:14.330
Are you alright?

32:19.350 --> 32:20.610
Don't be angry with me.

32:22.580 --> 32:23.580
You think if you're mean to me,

32:23.580 --> 32:24.820
you'll scare me away?

32:26.830 --> 32:28.690
I've searched for you for so long.

32:29.390 --> 32:30.750
I've thought about you for so long.

32:30.750 --> 32:31.720
How could I possibly

32:31.720 --> 32:33.120
be scared away so easily?

32:35.550 --> 32:37.010
Run! Don't worry about me!

32:37.100 --> 32:38.580
So what's your name?

32:38.790 --> 32:39.790
My name is Man Ying!

32:39.790 --> 32:40.480
Now, run!

32:46.630 --> 32:48.230
I remember I told you before.

32:49.900 --> 32:52.180
When I was little, I encountered danger.

32:53.160 --> 32:54.920
A boy named Man Ying

32:54.920 --> 32:55.590
saved me.

32:58.030 --> 32:59.790
He was injured while saving me.

33:01.460 --> 33:02.590
A drop of his blood fell

33:02.590 --> 33:03.720
into my left eye.

33:04.680 --> 33:05.550
Since then,

33:05.550 --> 33:07.160
I've been able to see demons.

33:10.170 --> 33:11.170
Everyone told me

33:11.200 --> 33:12.530
that it was just a dream.

33:14.240 --> 33:15.310
Only I knew

33:15.310 --> 33:16.440
it wasn't.

33:18.510 --> 33:20.030
But for some reason,

33:22.110 --> 33:23.350
I could never find

33:23.350 --> 33:24.350
that place again.

33:24.880 --> 33:26.740
I couldn't find Man Ying anymore.

33:30.510 --> 33:32.510
I thought that was the end.

33:34.940 --> 33:36.220
If it was a dream,

33:37.710 --> 33:39.370
one would eventually wake up.

33:40.310 --> 33:41.310
Wouldn't I become crazy

33:41.310 --> 33:43.240
if I lived in a dream forever?

33:46.400 --> 33:47.070
Xuanye...

33:50.270 --> 33:51.690
We've met again.

33:53.460 --> 33:54.440
It's just that you don't remember

33:54.440 --> 33:55.920
that you are Man Ying.

33:56.920 --> 33:58.180
You don't remember me.

34:01.550 --> 34:03.110
But I haven't forgotten.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.389
What's wrong?

34:31.110 --> 34:31.670
Xuanye!

34:32.469 --> 34:33.110
Xuanye!

34:39.800 --> 34:40.440
Beast.

34:41.110 --> 34:41.710
Attack!

34:49.550 --> 34:50.840
You've made a mistake!

34:52.630 --> 34:54.210
He's not the one who hurt people.

34:54.210 --> 34:54.810
Banxia!

34:54.850 --> 34:55.590
It's dangerous!

34:55.590 --> 34:56.650
Come here quickly!

34:58.560 --> 35:00.380
Don't hurt him! He's Xuanye!

35:02.510 --> 35:03.910
Catch the panther demon.

35:06.190 --> 35:06.880
Stop it!

35:07.530 --> 35:08.120
Stop it!

35:08.150 --> 35:08.870
Stop it!

35:12.030 --> 35:13.080
Xuanye, I'm fine.

35:13.710 --> 35:14.590
It's okay.

35:16.480 --> 35:17.110
Miss Duan.

35:20.000 --> 35:21.000
Immortal Master!

35:43.960 --> 35:44.630
Xuanye.

35:44.880 --> 35:45.590
Xuanye.

35:46.240 --> 35:46.800
Xuan...

35:47.190 --> 35:47.710
Master,

35:47.890 --> 35:48.330
he—

36:11.360 --> 36:12.680
Mother!

36:13.280 --> 36:14.650
Son!

36:15.190 --> 36:16.480
Son, son!

36:16.800 --> 36:17.960
You're back!

36:17.980 --> 36:19.340
Let me see if you're hurt.

36:19.340 --> 36:19.960
Mother.

36:20.000 --> 36:20.800
It's alright.

36:20.920 --> 36:22.230
There, there. Don't cry.

36:22.230 --> 36:24.030
Good child, it's alright, it's alright.

36:24.030 --> 36:25.070
It's good that you're back.

36:25.070 --> 36:26.400
It's good you're back.

36:27.460 --> 36:29.620
Don't cry now, it's okay, it's okay.

36:30.710 --> 36:32.280
My Lord, why did you arrest Banxia?

36:32.280 --> 36:33.280
She's not a demon.

36:33.610 --> 36:34.870
That's right, My Lord.

36:39.030 --> 36:40.030
Let me ask you all.

36:40.440 --> 36:42.320
The two Immortal Masters said

36:42.340 --> 36:44.440
that Xuanye is that black panther demon.

36:44.440 --> 36:45.500
Is it true or false?

36:46.770 --> 36:47.320
My Lord,

36:48.230 --> 36:48.630
that's just

36:48.630 --> 36:50.230
their one-sided statement.

36:53.760 --> 36:55.480
Then where is Xuanye now?

36:58.880 --> 37:00.840
Isn't Xuanye often away?

37:01.190 --> 37:02.990
Maybe he's gone to catch demons.

37:03.550 --> 37:04.960
But that rabbit demon

37:05.290 --> 37:06.730
is his companion, right?

37:09.700 --> 37:10.790
In that case,

37:10.920 --> 37:12.640
that case from six years ago

37:12.920 --> 37:14.190
must be related to him.

37:16.630 --> 37:18.150
This case has wide implications.

37:18.150 --> 37:19.710
Until it's fully investigated,

37:19.710 --> 37:20.370
Duan Banxia

37:20.630 --> 37:22.030
is not allowed to leave even half a step.

37:22.030 --> 37:22.590
-My Lord.
-My Lord.

37:22.590 --> 37:23.790
You may all leave now.

37:45.710 --> 37:46.520
Miss Duan,

37:47.190 --> 37:48.280
we meet again.

37:54.880 --> 37:57.010
You called that panther demon Xuanye.

37:58.260 --> 38:01.260
Could is be that the successor of the Eight Pillar Sect

38:01.360 --> 38:02.120
is a demon?

38:06.550 --> 38:07.950
Even if you don't tell me,

38:08.630 --> 38:09.830
I can still catch him.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.510
Did anyone actually see that panther demon

38:14.510 --> 38:16.030
abduct the child?

38:16.190 --> 38:16.670
Yes,

38:16.920 --> 38:17.960
it was witnessed.

38:23.260 --> 38:24.390
That's impossible.

38:27.640 --> 38:29.440
Xuanye would never harm anyone.

38:30.860 --> 38:32.520
The one who abducted the child

38:34.070 --> 38:35.360
must be another demon.

38:36.760 --> 38:38.360
You've got the wrong person.

38:40.550 --> 38:41.230
Masters,

38:41.510 --> 38:43.110
the child has been returned.

38:56.050 --> 38:57.080
Banxia is injured

38:57.480 --> 38:59.450
and the lord refuses to release her.

38:59.450 --> 39:00.740
I don't know if she can hold on

39:00.740 --> 39:01.740
in prison.

39:03.500 --> 39:04.580
Poor Banxia.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.410
I just never thought

39:08.290 --> 39:10.220
Xuanye was really a panther demon.

39:12.840 --> 39:14.840
I've known Xuanye for so many years,

39:15.930 --> 39:18.880
and have seen him catch so many demons with my own eyes.

39:18.880 --> 39:20.140
I never expected this.

39:20.620 --> 39:21.830
No wonder Chi Xue

39:22.030 --> 39:23.960
protected him at all costs before.

39:24.280 --> 39:25.370
It seems Banxia

39:25.500 --> 39:27.700
has known Xuanye's identity all along.

39:27.880 --> 39:28.960
So what if she knew?

39:30.150 --> 39:30.920
The kidnapped child

39:30.920 --> 39:32.540
has been released, hasn't he?

39:32.540 --> 39:34.070
It proves it wasn't Xuanye.

39:34.360 --> 39:35.420
But you should know

39:35.840 --> 39:37.000
that to the people,

39:37.550 --> 39:39.210
Xuanye will always be a demon.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.420
What does it matter if one is a demon or human?

39:43.110 --> 39:44.760
If demons don't harm and humans don't do evil,

39:44.760 --> 39:46.230
neither should be arrested.

39:46.230 --> 39:47.160
Why are you here?

39:47.670 --> 39:48.730
To help, of course.

39:50.190 --> 39:50.960
Help?

39:52.400 --> 39:53.400
You don't need it?

39:54.630 --> 39:55.290
We do.

39:56.360 --> 39:57.690
Better late than never.

39:58.960 --> 39:59.890
How can you help?

40:00.920 --> 40:02.050
By rescuing Banxia.

40:04.400 --> 40:06.360
I am a judicial commissioner of the Court of Judicial Review.

40:06.360 --> 40:08.680
I have the authority to supervise, impeach, and review cases.

40:08.680 --> 40:09.920
I believe this case of yours

40:09.920 --> 40:10.840
has been misjudged.

40:10.840 --> 40:12.540
So I want to bring out the detained suspect

40:12.540 --> 40:13.360
for questioning

40:13.360 --> 40:14.490
to review this case.

40:17.070 --> 40:18.660
Your rank is lower than Lord Geng's.

40:18.660 --> 40:19.860
How can you review it?

40:20.190 --> 40:21.650
We'll review it secretly.

40:23.150 --> 40:24.750
How secretly are we talking?

40:24.880 --> 40:27.030
We'll quietly bring the person out.

40:28.360 --> 40:30.070
What if someone tries to stop us?

40:30.070 --> 40:30.890
Knock them out.

40:30.890 --> 40:31.960
Isn't that a jailbreak?

40:31.960 --> 40:33.400
No, jailbreaking is illegal.

40:33.400 --> 40:35.460
This is just flexible case handling.

40:37.030 --> 40:37.400
Well,

40:38.070 --> 40:39.400
can we do it without knocking people out?

40:39.400 --> 40:39.960
Sure.

40:40.670 --> 40:41.670
You figure it out.

40:56.420 --> 40:57.230
Xuanye.

41:00.880 --> 41:01.510
Uncle.

41:02.440 --> 41:02.900
Xuan...

41:05.300 --> 41:05.860
Xuanye?

41:12.440 --> 41:13.150
She's awake.

41:13.150 --> 41:13.880
She's awake.

41:18.670 --> 41:19.670
Go find Xuanye.

41:20.930 --> 41:21.850
We need to go to

41:21.880 --> 41:22.960
the Underground City's Sky Cavern

41:22.960 --> 41:23.820
to find Xuanye.

41:24.510 --> 41:25.070
I know,

41:25.440 --> 41:27.350
but you're seriously injured right now.

41:27.350 --> 41:27.820
Come on.

41:28.400 --> 41:29.510
Rest for a while first.

41:29.510 --> 41:30.570
We'll go tomorrow.

41:46.110 --> 41:46.760
Uncle.

41:48.340 --> 41:49.130
Xuanye.

41:49.920 --> 41:50.720
You're awake.

41:52.960 --> 41:54.490
How long have I been asleep?

41:54.670 --> 41:56.000
You've been asleep for three days.

41:56.000 --> 41:56.510
Here.

41:56.680 --> 41:57.600
Three days?

41:57.630 --> 41:58.310
Drink some water.

41:58.310 --> 41:58.790
Come.

41:58.840 --> 41:59.300
Banxia.

41:59.960 --> 42:00.690
Don't worry.

42:01.710 --> 42:02.840
My people reported that

42:02.840 --> 42:03.400
Miss Duan

42:03.480 --> 42:05.800
has already been rescued by your friends.

42:05.800 --> 42:06.510
Rescued?

42:07.000 --> 42:07.440
Yes.

42:08.670 --> 42:09.190
Here.

42:09.910 --> 42:10.910
Drink some water.

42:11.800 --> 42:13.280
I've been busy taking care of you lately,

42:13.280 --> 42:14.880
so I couldn't look after her.

42:14.920 --> 42:15.650
Don't worry.

42:16.590 --> 42:18.650
I've already sent people to find her.

42:19.960 --> 42:20.960
Thank you, Uncle.

42:23.920 --> 42:25.030
I've been keeping an eye on

42:25.030 --> 42:26.630
the situation in Guangping.

42:26.710 --> 42:27.920
I heard you were in trouble,

42:27.920 --> 42:29.580
so I rushed over immediately.

42:29.920 --> 42:32.120
But I didn't expect to be a step too late.

42:35.280 --> 42:35.880
Xuanye,

42:42.960 --> 42:44.290
your Peerless Bracelet

42:45.400 --> 42:46.320
was shattered in the painted world

42:46.320 --> 42:47.850
by the Moon-Fearing Demon.

42:48.340 --> 42:50.140
Without the Peerless Bracelet,

42:51.020 --> 42:52.690
you revealed your true form.

42:53.960 --> 42:55.110
Uncle, you've known

42:55.110 --> 42:56.190
my identity for a while, haven't you?

42:56.190 --> 42:56.840
Yes,

42:57.510 --> 42:58.230
but the Peerless Bracelet

42:58.230 --> 42:59.630
is an extremely rare magic tool.

42:59.630 --> 43:00.290
The method of its creation

43:00.290 --> 43:01.360
was known only to your father.

43:01.360 --> 43:01.970
So I...

43:02.000 --> 43:03.630
It's just a clever illusion.

43:04.360 --> 43:05.760
I don't want another one.

43:06.190 --> 43:06.760
What?

43:07.310 --> 43:08.910
Are you blaming your father?

43:11.030 --> 43:11.670
Xuanye,

43:12.190 --> 43:12.840
